                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Grade D combines a 30.4% default rate with $3.07B exposure and should be prioritised.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;EVIDENCE</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Matured default rate 20.0%; base-case expected loss $1.94B (10.0% of matured funded exposure).</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;BUSINESS MEANING</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Default rates alone understate loss concentration in large grades such as C.</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;RECOMMENDED ACTION</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Review underwriting and pricing for Prioritise segments.</run>
